# BreastCare AI — Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your key.

# Required for the AI explanation panel (Layers 4+5 of the pipeline).
# WITHOUT this key: ML prediction + SHAP explainability still work fully.
# WITH this key: the Gemini AI explanation and Q&A panel activate.
#
# HOW TO GET A FREE KEY (no credit card required):
#   1. Go to https://aistudio.google.com
#   2. Sign in with your Google account
#   3. Click "Get API key" → "Create API key"
#   4. Copy the key and paste it below
#
GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-key-here

# ── Optional: independent judges for the evaluations only (src/evals/common.py) ──
# The app never uses these. They let models from other families grade the assistant's
# answers and red-team replies, alongside the Gemini judge. Each judge takes part only
# when its key is set. All three have free tiers (limits checked 2026-10-13).
#
# Recommended: Cerebras, gpt-oss-120b (1M tokens/day free).
#   1. Go to https://cloud.cerebras.ai and sign up (free)
#   2. Open "API Keys" and create a key
#   3. Paste it below and remove the leading "#"
# CEREBRAS_API_KEY=your-cerebras-key-here
#
# Optional second judge: Groq, qwen3.8-27b and gpt-oss-120b (about 1,000 requests/day free).
#   https://console.groq.com → API Keys → Create API Key
# GROQ_API_KEY=your-groq-key-here
#
# Optional: OpenRouter (free models allow only about 50 requests/day without credits).
#   https://openrouter.ai/keys ; also name a free model, e.g. one ending in ":free"
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your-openrouter-key-here
# OPENROUTER_JUDGE_MODEL=provider/model:free
